@startuml report-aduan-flow
title Pengelolaan Dukungan — Aduan: User lapor (Mobile) → Admin tindak (Dashboard)
' Sumber: prd-dashboard.md §5.8 (FR-ADM-SUP-*) + prd-mobile.md §5.1 (FR-MOB-RPT-01). add-content-reports.

actor "Pengguna\n(Rejki Mobile)" as user
actor "Admin\n(Dashboard)" as admin
participant "report-service" as svc
participant "require_admin" as rbac
participant "StorageClient" as stor
database "schema report\n(report)" as db
participant "NotificationClient" as notif

== Pelaporan (sisi Mobile — prasyarat) ==
user -> svc : POST /reports {target(iklan|user), keterangan, foto bukti}
svc -> stor : presigned upload bukti → object_key
svc -> db : report(status=pending, evidence_object_key)

== Tindak lanjut (sisi Dashboard) ==
admin -> rbac : GET /admin/reports?status=... (Bearer admin)
rbac -> svc : role=admin OK
svc -> db : list aduan
admin -> svc : klik ikon Mata → popup (+ Foto Bukti)
admin -> svc : isi "tindakan yang dilakukan" (wajib) + Tolak|Terima
alt Terima
  svc -> db : status → resolved (+ action_note, reviewed_by)
else Tolak
  svc -> db : status → rejected (+ action_note)
end
svc -> notif : send + send_email ke pihak terdampak
note over svc
  Tombol Tolak/Terima terkunci setelah verifikasi aduan.
  Admin tak dapat mengubah data aduan; bisa search (ID pengguna/ID aduan),
  sort by status, Export CSV.
end note
@enduml
